<section class="how">
    <h2>How to Use This Fancy Text Generator</h2>
    <p>Using this font creator is incredibly straightforward and quite fun. All you have to do is locate the text box above and start typing out your chosen phrase. You can also paste copied paragraphs directly into the box. As soon as you type the letters our tool instantly works its magic behind the scenes to convert your regular keyboard characters into unique stylistic symbols.</p>
    <p>You will see a large list of diverse choices automatically appear right below your input. Scroll down through the options until you find the exact aesthetic that matches your mood or brand. We included everything from bold lettering and cursive handwriting styles to quirky bubble letters and reversed text variations. Finding your favorite is very easy. Once you spot it simply tap the copy button next to it. You can now open your social application and paste it straight onto your profile page.</p>
</section>

<section class="formula">
    <h2>How Does the Text Conversion Actually Work?</h2>
    <p>This tool might seem like it is creating brand new typefaces but the technology relies entirely on a massive global text standard called Unicode. Most internet systems run on Unicode which organizes thousands of unique mathematical alphanumeric symbols glyphs and characters from hundreds of languages across the entire world into one directory.</p>
    <p>When you type a standard letter like the letter a our system runs a rapid substitution process. We have mapped out specific visual alphabet pathways utilizing these obscure global characters. The script instantly swaps your regular keyboard input for visually striking combinations sourced deeply from the massive Unicode character registry. Because they are authentic characters and not software font files you can comfortably paste them anywhere that normal text is accepted.</p>
</section>

