<section class="faq">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    
    <h3>Will this fancy font show up properly on Instagram and TikTok bio pages?</h3>
    <p>Yes these characters are widely supported across almost all modern social media applications. Instagram TikTok Twitter Facebook and WhatsApp all natively process these Unicode symbols beautifully. Your followers will see the stylized lettering exactly as you see it generated here on the page regardless of whether they are using a smartphone or a desktop computer.</p>
    
    <h3>Why do some letters appear as small empty boxes on my very old phone?</h3>
    <p>The empty boxes usually mean your hardware device is running a deeply outdated operating system version. Older smartphones occasionally lack the updated Unicode libraries required to accurately render newer or more obscure character sets. Updating your phone software will instantly fix that visual error for good.</p>
    
    <h3>Does this tool cost any money if I use it constantly?</h3>
    <p>No this font creator is entirely free to use as frequently as you desire. We do not restrict your usage pace limits or word counts and we will never ask you to register for an online account just to copy basic typography symbols.</p>
